                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi k
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
                  of the Cartesian product formed in
                  = succeed "." do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi Top
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Top
          %p
            This is due to (
            %a{:href => "compactly+generated+topological+space#Steenrod67"}> Steenrod 67
            ), expanded on in (
            %a{:href => "compactly+generated+topological+space#Lewis78"}> Lewis 78, appendix A
