                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/small+object+argument"} small object argument
                then implies all the trivial cofibrations are in
                = succeed "." do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
